# RAN 2026-10-31 (results PR #514, docs/sanaro.md section 16): HS +0.55 ± 0.31, HD +0.39, HT +0.35 over
# 0.2; survival 19 to 23. N8 (pc-sanaro-n07) confirms HS on fresh seeds before 0.3.
# Sanaro's stage N7 (docs/sanaro.md section 16): Hadur as the teacher. A nano cannot learn in a
# battle, but a table costs it two bytes however long it is (SANARO-8), so the card first seats
# Hadur 3.20 as the tenth robot of Sanaro's NanoMelee census and records its bullet-power decision at
# every shot (shots.csv, BENCH-155: own energy, the target's energy and distance, robots alive), then
# distils those rows into Sanaro-shaped power tables (tools/distill.py, BENCH-156) and measures them
# on 0.2's body against 0.2 as it ships. Nothing shipped changes; the tables live in arms.
#   ./queue.sh run pc-sanaro-n06        (or  .\queue.ps1 run pc-sanaro-n06)
# Run it from master:
#   git checkout master && git pull
# One bench queue, RoboRumble workers at 0, unpinned, 12 workers. Every step resumes; no step needs
# a decision. Nothing here touches Hadur, Saor, TwinSaor, Deise, JayLexi or Eveimear.
#
# Teach: Hadur 3.20 in the 13 NanoMelee census fields (nanomelee-census.txt, both leaders in every
# field) x 10 seeds (base 21000) = 130 battles, about 20 min at 12 wide; melee reads the nano field
# at Hadur's own width. Its only product is work/sanaro-n06/teach/*/battles/*/shots.csv; the report is
# kept for the record (Hadur in a nano field is not a result).
# Arms (sanaro-arms/arms.txt, written against 0.2's source, each 249 B: a table changes no code):
#   S2    Sanaro 0.2 as it ships (control)
#   HT    Hadur's power, every shot: modal power per 4 x 2 energy block, row neighbours for thin ones
#   HD    Hadur's power from shots with three or fewer alive, 4 x 4 blocks: its endgame policy, played always
#   HS    Hadur's power only on 2 x 2 blocks that caught twenty or more shots; 0.2's formula elsewhere
# distill-report prints each table's coverage (cells from data, from the row, from the formula)
# before any arm fights, so a thin teach run is seen in the log rather than in the score.
# Live-shaped census: 43 fields x 10 fresh seeds (base 22000) = 430 battles an arm, about 28 min an
# arm (n05 ran 26-30). About 2.2 h in all with the teach run.
# Read against S2. An arm passes when its difference's low end is above zero (SANARO-13). A passing
# arm ships as 0.3 (or joins n05's winner: a table and a lead change different lines); HT against HD
# says whether Hadur's crowd power or its endgame power is the one worth carrying.
# Stop rules on every census step (docs/bench/watch.md; halt, every battle fought is kept and a
# rerun resumes): 20 failed battles (a broken jar), no battle in 30 minutes (a hung step), or 40+
# skipped turns a battle over the last 100 (the PR #331 build-up). A halt at worst leaves the rest
# of that arm and the arms after it unrun, at most 1,290 battles (about 1.4 h). There is no early
# finish on score: a census step is one robot, so there is no arm to call futile mid-step. ALERT
# opens an issue for Leigh on a stop.

set MVN = mvn -q -Drobocode.version=1.11.1 compile exec:java
set OUT = ../docs/bench/local
set ALERT = lgriffin
set ARMS = S2,HT,HD,HS

prep | (cd .. && mvn -q -DskipTests install -pl hadur-robot,sanaro -am) && mkdir -p work/sanaro-n06 && cp ../hadur-robot/target/hadur117.Hadur_3.20.jar work/sanaro-n06/ && cp ../sanaro/target/hadur117.nano.Sanaro_0.2.jar opponents/ && ./fetch-opponents.sh --set nanomelee-field.txt && for f in nanomelee-census/f*.txt; do ./fetch-opponents.sh --set "$f" || exit 1; done && printf '%s\n' --suite nanomelee-census.txt --seeds 10 --seed-base 21000 --rounds 35 --parallel 12 --child-heap 2G --cpu-constant 1488498 --robot-jar work/sanaro-n06/hadur117.Hadur_3.20.jar --robot "hadur117.Hadur 3.20" --out work/sanaro-n06/teach --report ${OUT}/sanaro-n06-teach.md > work/sanaro-n06/teach.args

teach | ${MVN} "-Dexec.args=@work/sanaro-n06/teach.args"
  after: prep
  watch: battles=130
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100

distill-report | python3 tools/distill.py power work/sanaro-n06/teach/*/battles/*/shots.csv --own-step 4 --enemy-step 2 --min 5 --reach 3 --report && python3 tools/distill.py power work/sanaro-n06/teach/*/battles/*/shots.csv --alive 3 --own-step 4 --enemy-step 4 --min 5 --reach 4 --report && python3 tools/distill.py power work/sanaro-n06/teach/*/battles/*/shots.csv --own-step 2 --enemy-step 2 --min 20 --reach 0 --report
  after: teach

arms | SANARO_RUN=n06 bash tools/sanaro_arms.sh live 10 22000 ${ARMS}
  after: distill-report

live-S2 | ${MVN} "-Dexec.args=@work/sanaro-n06/live-S2.args"
  after: arms
  watch: battles=430
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100

live-HT | ${MVN} "-Dexec.args=@work/sanaro-n06/live-HT.args"
  after: live-S2
  watch: battles=430
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100

live-HD | ${MVN} "-Dexec.args=@work/sanaro-n06/live-HD.args"
  after: live-HT
  watch: battles=430
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100

live-HS | ${MVN} "-Dexec.args=@work/sanaro-n06/live-HS.args"
  after: live-HD
  watch: battles=430
  stop: fails 20
  stop: stall 30m
  stop: skips 40 over 100

read-live | python3 tools/sanaro_read.py --work-root work/sanaro-n06 --field live --arms ${ARMS} --control S2 --only work/sanaro-n06/live/micro.txt --live 66.41 > ${OUT}/sanaro-n06-live.md
  after: live-HS

pr | bash tools/open_results_pr.sh claude/pc-sanaro-n06-results "Sanaro stage N7: Hadur as the teacher, its power tables on 0.2's body, on the live-shaped census" ${OUT}/sanaro-n06-live.md ${OUT}/sanaro-n06-live-*.md ${OUT}/sanaro-n06-teach.md
  after: read-live
